  "title": {
   "en": "Uterus of the Blackgoat"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "Uterus of the Blackgoat 黒山羊の仔袋"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Uterus of the Blackgoat - Kuroyagi no Kobukuro"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "In 1948, during the Berlin Blockade incident, there was a hidden conflict between the Eastern and Western spy agencies over the discoveries of a Nazi Germany occult research organization known as Ahnenerbe.\n\nThe CIA and the Soviet State Security Ministry were engaged in a fierce battle to obtain Nazi experimental records, which involved offering priestesses as sacrifices to the ancient god Shub-Niggurath to open gates to other dimensions.\n\nAt the heart of this struggle was a mysterious witch named Lady MacLeod, whose objective was to thwart the progress of both organizations and bury the forbidden knowledge in darkness. Lady MacLeod possessed a power called the “Uterus of the Blackgoat”, which allowed her to command eldritch creatures from other realms. Known by the codename “H-21”, she was a legendary female spy and, in truth, the enigmatic figure behind the infamous Mata Hari.\n___\n**Setting Supervisor:** [Uchida Hiroki](https://mangadex.org/author/b8c982f3-3e64-4ba1-91f9-4667ad24fa39)",
   "ja": "1948年ベルリン封鎖事変……その背後には、ナチスドイツ秘学機関アーネンエルベの成果を巡る東西スパイ組織の暗闘があった。蕃神シュブ＝ニグラスに巫女の肉を捧げ異界の門を開いたナチスの実験記録を奪取せんと争うＣＩＡとソヴィエト国家保安省。そして両組織の行く手を阻み、禁断の知識を闇に葬るべく暗躍する一人の魔女。その名はレディ・マクロード。蕃神との契約で異界の魔獣を使役する『黒山羊の仔袋』であり、暗号名Ｈ－２１で知られる伝説の女スパイ、即ちマタ・ハリの正体である――。"
  },
